        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Galeria Fundana, Vitellius, Galba, Otho\n- Roles: Roman empress, Roman emperor\n- Events: Year of the Four Emperors, Roman civil war\n\nFacts:\n- Galeria Fundana lived circa 40 to after 69 CE.\n- Galeria Fundana was a Roman empress of the 1st century CE.\n- Galeria Fundana was the second wife of the Roman emperor Vitellius.\n- Vitellius was proclaimed emperor after the quick succession of the previous emperors Galba and Otho.\n- Vitellius became emperor during the Roman civil war known as the Year of the Four Emperors.",
